# This is a Unix-shell project: the interpreter emits LF, and the test fixtures
# (tests/expected/*.out) and scripts are LF-sensitive. Normalize everything to LF
# in the repo AND on checkout so the suite is portable across platforms.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary artifacts — never apply EOL conversion.
mercurial-history.hg binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.pdb binary
